{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57003","headline":"陈藏器引俗语 · 佚名","name":"陈藏器引俗语","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"韭是草锺乳，芡是水硫磺。\n（《古谣谚》卷三十八引陈藏器《本草拾遗》）（按：《重修政和经史证类备用本草》卷二十三引陈藏器《本草》作「韭叶是草种乳」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57003.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57003","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}